# ROADS-0 / PICTURE-OBJECTS-1: placing a land road (2520) via the developer tool reaches
# Visibility::Visible (never NoVisualChange), increments picture.tile_objects, rotates, and
# demolishes back down; demolishing an empty tile reports NoVisualChange, and demolishing a
# pre-existing forest tree (1188 516) clears it visually (Visible) while redemolish is NoVisualChange.
look 1156 516
wait frames 10
expect fact picture.tile_objects == 0
expect fact picture.cleared_tiles == 0

key b
select 2520
rotate 0
click 1156 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
expect fact picture.tile_objects == 1
checkpoint road_rot0_visible

rotate 1
click 1157 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
expect fact picture.tile_objects == 2
checkpoint road_rot1_visible

key x
click 1156 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
expect fact picture.tile_objects == 1
checkpoint road_demolished_visible

click 1156 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait drawn
expect visibility NoVisualChange
expect fact picture.tile_objects == 1
checkpoint empty_demolish_no_visual_change

click 1188 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
expect fact picture.tile_objects == 1
expect fact picture.cleared_tiles == 2
checkpoint tree_demolish_visible

click 1188 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait drawn
expect visibility NoVisualChange
expect fact picture.cleared_tiles == 2
checkpoint tree_redemolish_no_visual_change
quit
